age\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee Unarmed Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee Unarmed <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_LOW_Multiattack_Cazador</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_Multiattack_Cazador\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_Multiattack_Cazador\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsEnemySpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsEnemySpell (spell flag)\">IsEnemySpell</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Vampire\" title=\"Vampire\">Vampire</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This attack will benefit from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Sources_(Condition)\" title=\"Ritual Sources (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual Sources\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Sources_(Condition)\" title=\"Ritual Sources (Condition)\">Ritual Sources</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sinister_Lord_(Condition)\" title=\"Sinister Lord (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Generic_Light_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Light_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Generic_Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Light_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Generic_Light_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Light_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sinister Lord\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Generic_Light_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Generic_Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sinister_Lord_(Condition)\" title=\"Sinister Lord (Condition)\">Sinister Lord</a> gaining between <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">7d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> bonus damage per hit.</li>\n<li>Despite the description, this attack can target anything and is not restricted to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood-Sapped_(Condition)\" title=\"Blood-Sapped (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood-Sapped\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood-Sapped_(Condition)\" title=\"Blood-Sapped (Condition)\">Blood-Sapped</a> targets.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715063418\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.090 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.095 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3953/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 60903/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 23054/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.030/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1428069/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   79.650      1 -total\n 99.30%   79.091      1 Template:Feature_page\n 78.43%   62.467     56 Template:Trim\n 24.68%   19.660     11 Template:Icon_text\n 20.80%   16.568      8 Template:Icon_link\n 17.65%   14.057      3 Template:SmCond\n 15.37%   12.246      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 12.21%    9.722      1 Template:SmSAI\n  9.34%    7.442      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.85%    7.051      4 Template:Condition_inline/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27828-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715063418 and revision id 295169. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}